<Base title="About">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <div class="prose" style="margin-top:2rem">
    <p>I'm Zarar Siddiqi, an engineering leader with more than twenty years building and leading software teams. What I care about is secure software, delivery you can measure, and growing people. I work fast and expect the same.</p>

    <h2>What I've done</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Engineering Director, Payments &amp; AI Enablement</strong> at a major North American bank. Coached a real-time payments program from Scrumfall to continuous delivery, helped build AI-assisted vulnerability scanning across 100+ repositories, and led the shift to AI-assisted development.</li>
      <li><strong>Agile and engineering coach</strong> at the same bank, across a rewards platform and its online banking portfolio. Brought DORA metrics, trunk-based development and continuous delivery pipelines to 18 teams, and built a shared pipeline used by 50+ teams.</li>
      <li><strong>Co-founder and CTO of <a href="https://www.jumpcomedy.com/">Jump</a></strong>, a payments and event-management platform for comics, promoters and venues across the US and Canada. A distributed Elixir/Phoenix system with multi-region data residency, run by a small senior team that leans on AI.</li>
      <li><strong>Senior Engineering Manager</strong> at a global engineering services firm, where I grew the organization from 20 to 150 engineers.</li>
      <li>Before that: engineering manager, technical lead and architect, and developer roles in insurance, higher education and consulting.</li>
    </ul>

